el turns **counterclockwise** everywhere, so $\\operatorname{curl}\\mathbf F\\ne\\mathbf 0$ everywhere. Wrap the fingers of your right hand counterclockwise: the thumb points out of the page, in the **positive $z$-direction**. The field is **not irrotational**.\n\n- $\\operatorname{curl}\\mathbf F=\\mathbf 0$ everywhere: **false**.\n\n- $\\mathbf F$ is irrotational: **false**.\n\n- $\\operatorname{curl}\\mathbf F\\ne\\mathbf 0$ everywhere: **true**.\n\n- $\\operatorname{curl}\\mathbf F$ points in the negative $z$-direction everywhere: **false**."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186700147 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5abbeefb-9d65-5618-886d-fb63e03d3370" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700135} {:answer/id #uuid "d50b5f95-1c5e-54ba-a7da-829214ce05ac" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700162}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5abbeefb-9d65-5618-886d-fb63e03d3370" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700135} :answer-field/id #uuid "08d0ba8e-cc6e-5552-a79f-485ce4062b09" :answer-field/key "$\\operatorname{curl}\\mathbf F$ points in the positive $z$-direction everywhere" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700114} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e6fee981-c89e-50d6-868e-dbe0e70c03c4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700167} {:answer/id #uuid "f571e3e7-c596-5f1b-9db0-03e437f2194e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700174}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f571e3e7-c596-5f1b-9db0-03e437f2194e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/re