hoices [{:answer/id #uuid "da054dc1-26cc-52a8-acfa-0aed58e8ac76" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700684}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "da054dc1-26cc-52a8-acfa-0aed58e8ac76" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700684} :answer-field/id #uuid "51ef351a-dbe4-5565-8fd6-41e81d257a6e" :answer-field/key "value-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700668} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7e8a711e-772c-56e6-9249-8b2a8b151b6d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700672}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7e8a711e-772c-56e6-9249-8b2a8b151b6d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700672} :answer-field/id #uuid "d1835d7a-6a42-5d90-bd64-9b9f96d53d3f" :answer-field/key "value-4" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700683}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "11084468-ab64-506f-93de-da7e1e300b04" :question/problem "Complete the table for $y=1-\\dfrac{x}{2}$. Then plot the ordered pairs on paper and select the graph of the line.\n\n| $x$ | $-4$ | $-2$ | $2$ | $4$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $y$ | {{value-1}} | {{value-2}} | {{value-3}} | {{value-4}} |\n\nThe axes in every graph use one unit per grid square." :question/worked-solution "Substitute each given value of $x$ into $y=1-\\dfrac{x}{2}$ to find its corresponding $y$-value.\n\n- If $x=-4$, then $y=1-\\dfrac{-4}{2}=1+2=3$.\n\n- If $x=-2$, then $y=1-\\dfrac{-2}{2}=1+1=2$.\n\n- If $x=2$, then $y=1-\\dfrac{2}{2}=1-1=0$.\n\n- If $x=4$, then $y=1-\\dfrac{4}{2}=1-2=-1$.\n\n| $x$ | $-4$ | $-2$ | $2$ | $4$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $y$ | $3$ | $2$ | $0$ | $-1$ |\n\nPlot the ordered pairs $(-4,3)$, $(-2,2)$, $(2,0)$, $(4,-1)$:\n\n![](images/17/175b18e01817f344aa2290a60e6dabc96f96e1eecf53c510c9062d6f4912cb87.png)\n\nDraw a straight line through the points and extend it in both directions. This is the graph of $y=1-\\dfrac{x}{2}$:\n\n![](images/6e/6e50f8b3df565d1f92e0646e698df34cd1a64e8670b2f2529ef76264992d22ce.png)\n\nKeep the coordinates in $(x,y)$ order. For example, the point for $x=-4$ is $(-4,3)$, not $(3,-4)$. The line passes through all four calculated points; matching its downward direction alone is insufficient."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186700661 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1efa3d4b-8487-5b66-8341-f75a41537c7e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/aa/aac8dfba98d9244ce721f6d7e103e6292622184cc9fa8ebad5f66d43503a8a45.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700662} {:answer/id #uuid "33bd8dc3-9326-5e1e-8e98-d3bd38c456c1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/0d/0d6fb841b0c2dd1cb53997ad1a4b8d6923143aee9215661f59cd80ea0b0dea70.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700666} {:answer/id #uuid "6ba6f84c-7fcb-515f-a510-bc4699e84384" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/31/3197955a6343384cc573249dca120c5e635c2f4ebb87f2216409819f39285900.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700670} {:answer/id #uuid "ab2cc26f-ae96-50a1-81ba-ec7699b1eb1e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/b2/b2e7aad5e80e93290d6630f175493a99be30042d5a4c77cc8a5b41af73deb6b0.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700678} {:answer/id #uuid "c80a9ae8-08b7-5c54-bf51-aaffaa11020f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/72/72eb217e84bb6bc9c7c8838e99717515e06fc49381c358e0ba0531bd1a6976bd.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700682}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6ba6f84c-7fcb-515f-a510-bc4699e84384" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/31/3197955a6343384cc573249dca120c5e635c2f4ebb87f2216409819f39285900.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700670} :answer-field/id #uuid "5642b6b8-6063-5245-ab6f-39f252925cf2" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700669}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "1b81c220-aee5-5e5c-bf18-ca56f942283a" :question/problem "Copy and complete the table below and use it to determine which of the following is the graph of $y=x+1$.\n\n| $x$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ | $3$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $y$ |  |  |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "Substitute each given value of $x$ into $y=x+1$ to find its corresponding $y$-value.\n\n- If $x=0$, then $y=0+1=1$.\n\n- If $x=1$, then $y=1+1=2$.\n\n- If $x=2$, then $y=2+1=3$.\n\n- If $x=3$, then $y=3+1=4$.\n\n| $x$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ | $3$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $y$ | $1$ | $2$ | $3$ | $4$ |\n\nPlot the ordered pairs $(0,1)$, $(1,2)$, $(2,3)$, $(3,4)$:\n\n![](images/0d/0def264a2f1048823772687bebba3e983773c325a1d3a819fa17eefc8aae65a0.png)\n\nDraw a straight line through the points and extend it in both directions. This is the graph of $y=x+1$:\n\n![](images/31/3197955a6343384cc573249dca120c5e635c2f4ebb87f2216409819f39285900.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186700676 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1651b93b-660a-570c-ad3c-9ec9a200f275" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/5b/5ba943dc574fe9ccd4acb77bc14cc979286a52e7a961b576d69c1c315d41e3d1.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700659} {:answer/id #uuid "213789ae-1144-5492-8b76-c7f735c35fa1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/58/58f2263558ef80707849d39244aed63d944d784cf641b4c30ec5f78011d48e6b.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700663} {:answer/id #uuid "265d6d5e-f546-5eae-8d56-8cc93ae01832" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/b7/b7264b3909890b25343e3862219334be579b83c9fd77c8f949481de35e8e5052.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700664} {:answer/id #uuid "afc79373-3a0e-53cd-8556-5d4c75c6591c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/b8/b8e4984a956e952fa4f356920899c3a6c86839ff6af849aebe375d67fda3957b.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700679} {:answer/id #uuid "bbff9eaf-7825-5ed7-a19d-9ae288cd6ca9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/ff/ffe56754d5b400725b03aa9150313d8e21ca58943fbd83ec4d975878bdcd9939.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700681}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "afc79373-3a0e-53cd-8556-5d4c75c6591c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/b8/b8e4984a956e952fa4f356920899c3a6c86839ff6af849aebe375d67fda3957b.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700679} :answer-field/id #uuid "91ba5d24-c460-508b-8e2c-d30e6cea1ee4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700675}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "a74cee42-af12-5f21-8eb6-7445a857e0d3" :question/problem "Copy and complete the table below and use it to determine which of the following is the graph of $y=2-2x$.\n\n| $x$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ | $3$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $y$ |  |  |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "Substitute each given value of $x$ into $y=2-2x$ to find its corresponding $y$-value.\n\n- If $x=0$, then $y=2-2(0)=2$.\n\n- If $x=1$, then $y=2-2(1)=0$.\n\n- If $x=2$, then $y=2-2(2)=-2$.\n\n- If $x=3$, then $y=2-2(3)=-4$.\n\n| $x$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ | $3$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $y$ | $2$ | $0$ | $-2$ | $-4$ |\n\nPlot the ordered pairs $(0,2)$, $(1,0)$, $(2,-2)$, $(3,-4)$:\n\n![](images/11/115f577ba0aab6d656adc1dc790f75f52c630c4ab7f7db225d0e6873b2b911bc.png)\n\nDraw a straight line through the points and extend it in both directions. This is the graph of $y=2-2x$:\n\n![](images/b8/b8e4984a956e952fa4f356920899c3a6c86839ff6af849aebe375d67fda3957b.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186700718 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "efe68c96-e5ab-5410-ac6e-e2f093ad3b14" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700733}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "efe68c96-e5ab-5410-ac6e-e2f093ad3b14" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700733} :answer-field/id #uuid "0f0acff9-0683-5812-86a1-f75bddc8f9ee" :answer-field/key "y-four" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700711} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "de4335a4-bf46-515f-89d4-e7c140855d40" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700730}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "de4335a4-bf46-515f-89d4-e7c140855d40" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700730} :answer-field/id #uuid "3313fbc2-f8c0-55fe-8081-f63b7edba7f2" :answer-field/key "y-zero" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700712} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "04d4a538-bd8c-5b13-9702-b4127ddbe73b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/da/dab53d555a89020acf489c23b8e981af120de69de335dee00d52e0e48efd8737.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700708} {:answer/id #uuid "5ab227ed-5b31-5176-b41e-c1e20f48a00e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/9f/9f97b6ad9702c111e6046c432cdf5f79fcf4ddec9cd52d49792a6afe4e0d4bb3.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700717} {:answer/id #uuid "a51ab080-ae8b-509e-b323-b463531b4a4d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/35/35b2711a4528df62c04203b6e0c40129d698c6c7faeee08f68bc8ce2527995b2.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700723} {:answer/id #uuid "f4f411e4-0d4e-5fa2-b9e6-f1ff1c1cabc6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/ab/ab13b0014e1b468fab435af8a0509e6c88cf0630069cf092fe780dc44470f1f9.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700735} {:answer/id #uuid "fa66549e-40ab-59a9-bb83-ffd8e6300abd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/f1/f17d4f94b8d00f35235e9cd7fad35b10a506cc96345d52da4f6160e71d4d0571.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700736}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f4f411e4-0d4e-5fa2-b9e6-f1ff1c1cabc6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/ab/ab13b0014e1b468fab435af8a0509e6c88cf0630069cf092fe780dc44470f1f9.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700735} :answer-field/id #uuid "bf9f9934-dc75-5ce5-b66e-93b3a068a4d5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700726}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "5b199d2f-29fb-53a4-9ace-9097ee0b1ddc" :question/problem "Use two points to sketch $y=\\frac{1}{2}x-2$.\n\nComplete the two $y$-coordinates, then choose the graph through both points.\n\nWhen $x=0$, $y=$ {{y-zero}}.\n\nWhen $x=4$, $y=$ {{y-four}}." :question/worked-solution "Substitute each given $x$-coordinate into the equation.\n\nFor $x=0$,\n$$\ny=\\frac{1}{2}(0)-2=-2,\n$$\nso the first point is $(0,-2)$.\n\nFor $x=4$,\n$$\ny=\\frac{1}{2}(4)-2=2-2=0,\n$$\nso the second point is $(4,0)$.\n\nPlot the two points and draw the straight line through them. Several choices pass through $(0,-2)$; the required graph also passes through $(4,0)$.\n\n![](images/1d/1dd329828659b6c264ed7beab92b582306beacc3a83da4a14bafabd57f6c7852.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186700720 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4a0d213c-36b4-5388-8297-6e9ff40457a0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/42/42681f96c7769b3e95ba5adf2986e4604e0e03d4a877fb2455e172eb1d61a43e.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700715} {:answer/id #uuid "57d1f47f-2bf0-5e58-ad5b-891862f43790" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/e6/e66f5fea8b38cfc0fe9c46b18cc9f7d3a3a3d42a156c061ba53d06b293989ad9.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700716} {:answer/id #uuid "997df45d-acde-513a-a292-3b388235d68f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/19/19451a9d1c85c1bc8eaca1cd033289f73dca7d56b71c5eb7a4cd68af2aa75cb4.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700721} {:answer/id #uuid "de4485bf-c3d6-5654-a3f8-7d32da81c135" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/15/15b20c37317414d4d531c99a1a3c34ea73d20ad3f526f63dea4aaea3be5c6518.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700731} {:answer/id #uuid "f40577cf-9476-5a87-9de1-e68dcfebc1bf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/62/62984efc2c905f8c47826540145dc02bfc79206adee075f222ee487c58978717.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700734}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f40577cf-9476-5a87-9de1-e68dcfebc1bf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/62/62984efc2c905f8c47826540145dc02bfc79206adee075f222ee487c58978717.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700734} :answer-field/id #uuid "06075e3d-155f-5868-8672-00a589da9780" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700709}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "9148bcd9-0845-5ca1-bc40-04f7f286702f" :question/problem "Which of the following graphs shows the line $y=-x+1$?" :question/worked-solution "Find two distinct points by substituting convenient values of $x$.\n\nFor $x=0$,\n$$\ny=-(0)+1=1,\n$$\nso one point is $(0,1)$.\n\nFor $x=2$,\n$$\ny=-(2)+1=-1,\n$$\nso another point is $(2,-1)$.\n\nPlot $(0,1)$ and $(2,-1)$ and draw a straight line through them. Choose the graph containing both points. A line through just one of them is not enough.\n\n![](images/d4/d4663aff93056fa7baadc80f556a78766dcb4ffe3f1aba9adba1a18833abb76b.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186700728 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0b2adc1f-35fa-57ef-96ec-6cd8a625da31" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(-2,3)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700710}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0b2adc1f-35fa-57ef-96ec-6cd8a625da31" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(-2,3)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700710} :answer-field/id #uuid "3bf4e3dd-ca46-589c-bb39-c1db5c4e3c96" :answer-field/key "point-left" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186700713} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4927f642-3f7c-5c71-be53-db54552eef95" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/9f/9f580a3b1a08d915bcd89f3d95b5e10f4da9ad7f9b3fe77e05c2fc54b5f23e5